# Generated corpora. Reproducible from the scripts here given mafia.db and
# EXPERIENTIAL_LABS_API_KEY, but they cost API budget to regenerate, so they are
# never committed. NOTE: a broad glob on purpose - listing specific filenames let
# play_new.jsonl, ogi_new.jsonl, *_subset.jsonl and friends leak into the PR once.
*.jsonl
!eval_set.jsonl

# generated viewer payload
game_view*.json

# Model intermediates. The runnable artifact (finetune_cls3_out/model.int8.onnx,
# 23 MB) IS committed; these are the 91 MB fp32 files it is quantised from.
finetune_cls3_out/model.onnx
finetune_cls3_out/model.safetensors

# harness dependencies
harness/node_modules/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
*.swp
